    "note": "Hashes were downloaded from the published v5.20.0 release assets and hashed independently; they match the release manifest and the published .sha256 sidecars for commit 21d68b3db2e96644e876a3d2cb8fd887f516b31f. v5.20.0 is the first engine release in which a distribution declares its own version: before it, `darq --version` reported the engine's number and `darq upgrade` compared that against DARQ's own release tag by string equality, so it re-downloaded and replaced the binary on every run without ever converging to already-current."
